<title>SINGAPORE: Mayfran director rids entire stake.</title>
<headline>Mayfran director rids entire stake.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mayfran International Ltd said on Monday one of its director, Chan Lai Wang, had sold all his stake to the company in the open market.</p>
<p>Chan disposed five million shares, representing 7.69 percent of the company's issued share capital, at an average of Singapore $0.50 per share on May 30, 1997, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Mayfran, which makes bed sheets and other household linen, now holds 38.92 percent of its issued share capital.</p>
<p>No reason was given for Chan's sale.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
